@startsalt
' Screen: Run List Page
' Related user stories:
'   US-20: As a QA engineer, I want to browse all runs with filtering by script/agent/status
'   US-21: As a QA engineer, I want to select two runs and compare them side-by-side
'   US-22: As a QA engineer, I want to quickly see the verdict and status of recent runs

{
  <b>Runs</b>                                                          | [+ Trigger Run]
  ==
  ' Filter bar
  {
    ^  All Scripts  ^ | ^  All Agents  ^ | ^  Status ▾  ^ | ^  Date Range  ^ | ^  Persona ▾  ^
    " Search by Run ID or tag... " | [  Apply Filters  ] | [ Clear ]
  }
  --
  ' Active filters
  <i>Filters: Status: running, failed · Script: checkout-flow · 12 results</i>
  ==
  ' Table header
  {#
    [ ] | <b>Run ID</b>   | <b>Script + Version</b>       | <b>Agent + Version</b>  | <b>Status</b>    | <b>Verdict</b>  | <b>Started</b>        | <b>Duration</b>
    --
    [X] | R-2847     | checkout-flow v3         | gpt-4o v2          | <color:blue>RUNNING</color>  | <i>pending</i>  | 2m ago           | 2m 14s
    --
    [X] | R-2846     | checkout-flow v3         | claude-3-opus v1   | <color:green>PASSED</color>  | <color:green>PASS</color>   | 18m ago          | 4m 02s
    --
    [ ] | R-2845     | return-flow v1           | gpt-4o v2          | <color:red>FAILED</color>    | <color:red>FAIL</color>     | 1h ago           | 1m 58s
    --
    [ ] | R-2844     | checkout-flow v2         | gpt-4-turbo v1     | <color:green>PASSED</color>  | <color:orange>WARN</color>  | 3h ago           | 3m 31s
    --
    [ ] | R-2843     | login-happy-path v5      | claude-3-haiku v2  | <color:grey>CANCELLED</color>| <i>n/a</i>      | 5h ago           | 0m 43s
  }
  ==
  ' Bulk action bar (visible when rows selected)
  {
    <b>2 selected</b> | [  Compare  ] | [ Cancel Selected ] | [ Export CSV ]
  }
  ==
  ' Pagination
  {
    [ ← Prev ] | Page 1 of 6 | [ Next → ]
    <i>Showing 5 of 28 runs</i>
  }
  ==
  ' Empty state (shown when no results)
  '  {
  '    <i>No runs match your current filters.</i>
  '    <i>Try clearing some filters or trigger a new run.</i>
  '    [Clear Filters]   [+ Trigger Run]
  '  }
}
@endsalt
